T("Ready-made looks for the 3D image, made from the sliders below: Natural is the game's own colours, Warm and Cool shift the light, Vivid and Cinematic add contrast, Muted calms the colours. The HUD and menus keep their colours.", "Visuais prontos para a imagem 3D, feitos com os controles abaixo: Natural são as cores do próprio jogo, Quente e Frio mudam a luz, Vívido e Cinematográfico acrescentam contraste, Suave acalma as cores. O HUD e os menus mantêm suas cores.")
